[627.122991, "o", " |       <LinearGaussianCPD: P(x3 | x2) = N(...) at 0x...>]\r\n |\r\n |  ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n |  Methods inherited from skbase.base._base.BaseEstimator:\r\n |\r\n"]
[627.123261, "o", " |  c\bch\bhe\bec\bck\bk_\b_i\bis\bs_\b_f\bfi\bit\btt\bte\bed\bd(self, method_name=None)\r\n |      Check if the estimator has been fitted.\r\n |\r\n |      Check if ``_is_fitted`` attribute is present and ``True``.\r\n"]
[627.123433, "o", " |      The ``is_fitted``\r\n |      attribute should be set to ``True`` in calls to an object's ``fit`` method.\r\n |\r\n |      If not, raises a ``NotFittedError``.\r\n |\r\n |      Parameters\r\n |      ----------\r\n |      method_name : str, optional\r\n |          Name of the method that called this function. If provided, the error\r\n |          message will include this information.\r\n |\r\n |      Raises\r\n |      ------\r\n |      NotFittedError\r\n |          If the estimator has not been fitted yet.\r\n |\r\n |  g\bge\bet\bt_\b_f\bfi\bit\btt\bte\bed\bd_\b_p\bpa\bar\bra\bam\bms\bs(self, deep=True)\r\n |      Get fitted parameters.\r\n |\r\n |      State required:\r\n |          Requires state to be \"fitted\".\r\n |\r\n"]
[627.123496, "o", " |      Parameters\r\n |      ----------\r\n\u001b[7m--More--\u001b[27m\r |      deep : bool, default=True\r\n\u001b[7m--More--\u001b[27m"]
[627.123547, "o", "\r |          Whether to return fitted parameters of components.\r\n |\r\n |          * If True, will return a dict of parameter name : value for this object,\r\n"]
[627.123839, "o", " |            including fitted parameters of fittable components\r\n |            (= BaseEstimator-valued parameters).\r\n |          * If False, will return a dict of parameter name : value for this object,\r\n |            but not include fitted parameters of components.\r\n |\r\n |      Returns\r\n |      -------\r\n |      fitted_params : dict with str-valued keys\r\n |          Dictionary of fitted parameters, paramname : paramvalue\r\n |          keys-value pairs include:\r\n |\r\n"]
[627.124065, "o", " |          * always: all fitted parameters of this object, as via ``get_param_names``\r\n |            values are fitted parameter value for that key, of this object\r\n |          * if ``deep=True``, also contains keys/value pairs of component parameters\r\n |            parameters of components are indexed as ``[componentname]__[paramname]``\r\n |            all parameters of ``componentname`` appear as ``paramname`` with its value\r\n |          * if ``deep=True``, also contains arbitrary levels of component recursion,\r\n"]
[627.124227, "o", " |            e.g., ``[componentname]__[componentcomponentname]__[paramname]``, etc\r\n |\r\n |  ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n |  Readonly properties inherited from skbase.base._base.BaseEstimator:\r\n |\r\n |  i\bis\bs_\b_f\bfi\bit\btt\bte\bed\bd\r\n |      Whether ``fit`` has been called.\r\n |\r\n |      Inspects object's ``_is_fitted` attribute that should initialize to ``False``\r\n |      during object construction, and be set to True in calls to an object's\r\n |      `fit` method.\r\n |\r\n"]
