[837.134449, "o", " |          List of nodes whose ancestral graph needs to be computed.\r\n |\r\n |      Returns\r\n |      -------\r\n |      Ancestral Graph: pgmpy.base.DAG\r\n |\r\n |      Examples\r\n |      --------\r\n |      >>> from pgmpy.base import DAG\r\n |      >>> dag = DAG([(\"A\", \"C\"), (\"B\", \"C\"), (\"D\", \"A\"), (\"D\", \"B\")])\r\n"]
